# ── Build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
site/dist/
site/.astro/
site/node_modules/
node_modules/

# ── Large source material, kept OUT of git ──────────────────────────────────
# These are the working originals: PDFs, page scrapes, competitor research and
# raw video. ~160 MB, and none of it is needed to build or deploy the site.
# They live on disk and should be backed up separately (Drive, an external
# disk) — git is for the source that produces site/dist.
research/
Videos/
assets-src/
prototype/
scrollcraft/
*.pdf

# LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING. An unanchored `catalogue/` matches a directory
# of that name at ANY depth, so it silently swallowed site/public/catalogue/ —
# the 216 product photos the built site links to. Anchored, it excludes only the
# top-level scrape folder, which is what was meant. 2026-09-14.
/catalogue/

# The 1.7 MB single-file export of the old site.
Candelx Surgicals Website.html
design-system-review.html

